<title>CHINA: CIBC sets warrants on basket of chemical stocks.</title>
<headline>CIBC sets warrants on basket of chemical stocks.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Canadian Imperial Bank of Commerce, London Branch, said on Friday it launched 400 million American-style call warrants on a basket of chemical stocks.</p>
<p>Each basket comprises of:  CNPC Hong Kong Ltd				  0.75 shrs</p>
<p> Shanghai Petrochemical Co Ltd   0.4 shrs</p>
<p>Jilin Chemical Industrial Co Ltd  0.25 shrs</p>
<p> Zhenhai Refining &amp; Chemical Co Ltd	    0.21 shrs</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one basket.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE     HK$3.5706     PREMIUM	 23.5 PCT</p>
<p>ISSUE PRICE</p>
<p>HK$0.1329 GEARING 2.99x</p>
<p> LAUNCH DATE	25.JUL.97     MIN EXER LOT  10,000</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	 27.JUL.98     LISTING	 HONG KONG</p>
<p> REFERENCE SPOT   HK$3.9673</p>
<p> NOTE		 PHYSICAL OR CASH SETTLEMENT AT ISSUER'S</p>
<p>			DISCRETION</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
